[38;2;124;124;124mSo the question reduces to: Does there exist a nonabelian finite simple group [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mwhose Schur multiplier has order divisible by an odd prime $p$?[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mNow I need to recall the Schur multipliers of finite simple groups. The Schur [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mmultipliers of the alternating groups $A_n$:[0m
